WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:01.550
Meet Shiprooms.

00:01.550 --> 00:04.660
The AI software factory
for the enterprise.

00:06.400 --> 00:09.700
Product teams research opportunities
with agents,

00:09.700 --> 00:12.400
then define initiatives
and measurable outcomes.

00:12.400 --> 00:15.360
Agents connect the research
and shape a shared plan.

00:17.200 --> 00:19.300
Designers and architects
set direction.

00:19.300 --> 00:23.500
Agents weigh options and make decisions
within agreed boundaries,

00:23.500 --> 00:28.400
bringing critical choices to people with
recommendations, trade-offs, and impact.

00:29.400 --> 00:32.850
Engineers guide specialist agents
building in parallel.

00:32.850 --> 00:35.000
They review consequential changes,

00:35.000 --> 00:38.280
while agents keep implementation
connected to the agreed design.

00:40.400 --> 00:44.200
Specialist agents check quality and
security against enterprise standards.

00:44.200 --> 00:47.100
They address routine findings
and surface risks

00:47.100 --> 00:50.640
that need quality or security teams
to investigate.

00:53.400 --> 00:57.900
Operations and infrastructure teams
investigate readiness and approve releases.

00:57.900 --> 01:00.500
Agents coordinate deployment,
monitor health,

01:00.500 --> 01:03.560
and surface issues
with the context to act.

01:05.400 --> 01:08.900
Agents turn production signals
into recommendations.

01:08.900 --> 01:10.700
Teams choose what comes next,

01:10.700 --> 01:13.880
carrying decisions and learning
into the next initiative.

01:15.400 --> 01:16.500
People lead.

01:16.500 --> 01:18.650
Agents move work forward.

01:18.650 --> 01:20.500
Knowledge compounds.

01:20.500 --> 01:21.880
Shiprooms.
